    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The thing is, the new tool literally can't flag logical fallacies or detect if a researcher is misinterpreting a core concept from a cited paper—it just checks if the citation is present and formatted correctly. I’m actually a bit worried that the quality of the reviews is going to tank because we'll lose that layer of critical analysis. Do you think there's any way to bridge that gap, or is the move to a purely deterministic system just inevitable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
